{"id":"fliege","lemma":"Fliege","pos":"noun","rank":1742,"glosses":["fly (insect)","bowtie"],"ipa":"/ˈfliːɡə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/19/De-Fliege.ogg/De-Fliege.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Fliege","plural":"Fliegen"},"formAudio":{"Fliegen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Fliegen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Es ist eine Fliege im Kaffee.","en":"There is a fly in the coffee.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"coffee"}]},{"text":"Ich habe eine Fliege gefangen.","en":"I caught a fly.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"caught"}]},{"text":"Eine Fliege kann an der Decke laufen.","en":"A fly can walk on the ceiling.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"any cloth or cushion…"},{"g":"to walk"}]},{"text":"Ich fliege mit dem Flugzeug.","en":"I'm going by plane.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/690485","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"aeroplane"}]},{"text":"Er trägt jeden Tag eine Fliege.","en":"He wears a bow tie every day.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to carry, to bear","l":"tragen"},{"g":"each","l":"jeder"},{"g":"day"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}